act that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_11","text":"I have a personal relationship with her","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_12","text":"is insane!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_13","text":"She even asked me to come over sometime!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_14","text":"OMG, is this for real?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_15","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_15","text":"Hehe, I can see you're quite happy.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_16","text":"You bet!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_17","text":"You have no idea how obsessed I used to be with Rupee.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_18","text":"I didn't say anything before because I didn't want to make a fuss,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_19","text":"but I'm a dyed-in-the-wool Lupin myself!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_20","text":"At first, I looked her up because I liked her designs,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_21","text":"but the more I saw of her, the more charming I found her to be.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_22","text":"Before I knew it, I was obsessed.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_23","text":"Rupee does have a certain charm that draws people in.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_24","text":"Absolutely, Teacher.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_25","text":"You've got a good eye.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_26","text":"Honestly, if it were anyone else, they'd be way out of your league,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_27","text":"but Rupee is a perfect match for you.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_28","text":"That's the best compliment I can offer.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_29","text":"So, consider it an honor.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_30","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_30","text":"Hahahaha, thanks.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_31","text":"All right,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_32","text":"you really should get some rest.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_33","text":"That applies to me as well!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_juveniledays_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ein","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_juveniledays_02_34","text":"Bye!","jump":null}],"chat":true}